{"t":"PLD","n":"Prologis, Inc.","nKo":"프롤로지스","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":125.14,"chg":2.64,"chgPct":0.02155,"prev":122.5,"dayH":125.87,"dayL":124.19,"w52H":153.35,"w52L":122.18,"vol":4078200,"avgVol":3612230,"mcap":121669992448,"pe":27.56,"fpe":34.74,"eps":4.54,"feps":3.6,"pb":2.13,"div":4.28,"divY":0.0342,"beta":1.29,"short":16891102,"shortPct":0.0203,"shortRatio":4.02,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Real Estate","sKo":"부동산","i":"REIT - Industrial","iKo":"REIT - 산업","city":"San Francisco","emp":2802,"web":"https://www.prologis.com","sum":"Prologis, Inc. don't just lead the industry, they define it. The firm creates the intelligent infrastructure that powers global commerce, seamlessly connecting the digital and physical worlds. From agile supply chains to clean energy solutions, their ecosystems help your business move faster, operate smarter and grow sustainably. With unmatched scale, innovation and expertise, Prologis is a category of onenot just shaping the future of logistics but building what comes next. Prologis, Inc. was established in 1983 and is incorporated in Maryland.","sumKo":"Prologis, Inc.는 업계를 선도할 뿐만 아니라 업계를 정의합니다. 이 회사는 글로벌 상거래를 지원하는 지능형 인프라를 구축하여 디지털 세계와 실제 세계를 원활하게 연결합니다. 민첩한 공급망부터 청정 에너지 솔루션까지, 생태계는 귀하의 비즈니스가 더 빠르게 움직이고, 더 스마트하게 운영되며, 지속 가능한 성장을 하도록 돕습니다. 비교할 수 없는 규모, 혁신 및 전문성을 갖춘 Prologis는 물류의 미래를 형성할 뿐만 아니라 미래를 구축하는 카테고리 중 하나입니다. Prologis, Inc.는 1983년에 설립되어 메릴랜드에 법인화되었습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":4913171000,"ni":3358796000},{"y":2023,"rev":6818542000,"ni":3053373000},{"y":2024,"rev":7514705000,"ni":3725754000},{"y":2025,"rev":8158904000,"ni":3322349000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":2092107000,"ni":1398227000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":2125084000,"ni":980476000},{"q":"2Q2026","rev":2177074000,"ni":1060844000},{"q":"3Q2026","rev":2205269000,"ni":815734000}],"eps":[{"q":"4Q2025","act":1.46,"est":0.684},{"q":"1Q2026","act":1.024,"est":0.725},{"q":"2Q2026","act":1.107,"est":0.747},{"q":"3Q2026","act":0.842,"est":0.79}]},"tr